---
// src/components/FinalCTA.astro
// Final CTA Turma Alpha: 10 Vagas, R$ 197/mês, acompanhamento individual com Gabe + Portal Lexi Alpha
// Zero travessões, zero emojis, padrão visual Datamind / Crysiam
---

<section class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-background border-t border-[#242424] relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glows de Fundo no estilo Crysiam / Datamind -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[650px] h-[350px] bg-[#3ecf8e]/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <!-- Badge de Vagas Limitadas -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full badge-glow mb-6">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e] animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#3ecf8e] font-mono tracking-wide">Apenas 10 Vagas &bull; Turma Alpha</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline -->
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gradient-title leading-[1.15] mb-5 tracking-tight">
      Pronto para começar a falar de verdade?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[#898989] text-base sm:text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Como conduzo pessoalmente as sessões individuais de cada aluno, a Turma Alpha é estritamente limitada a 10 pessoas. Sem promessas vazias de fluência instantânea: apenas método, consistência diária e dedicação real.
    </p>

    <!-- Comparação Rápida em Cards Glass-Panel -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Card Modelo Tradicional -->
      <div class="glass-panel border border-red-500/20 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 text-xs font-bold">
            &times;
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#fafafa] text-sm sm:text-base tracking-tight">
            Modelo Tradicional
          </h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#898989]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&times;</span>
            <span>Travar e congelar quando alguém fala com você em inglês</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&times;</span>
            <span>Mensalidades caras por anos sem produzir uma conversa fluida</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&times;</span>
            <span>Exercícios mecânicos de gramática sem contexto real de fala</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&times;</span>
            <span>Prometer no início de todo ano que "agora vai" e desistir</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card Turma Alpha -->
      <div class="glass-panel border border-[#3ecf8e]/40 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-[#3ecf8e]/5">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 right-5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e] text-[#0f0f0f] text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm">
          Turma Alpha
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e]/15 border border-[#3ecf8e]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#3ecf8e] text-xs font-bold">
            &check;
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#fafafa] text-sm sm:text-base tracking-tight">
            Método Gabe + Lexi Alpha
          </h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#fafafa]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3ecf8e] mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[#d4d4d8]">Encontros individuais semanais ao vivo com o Gabe</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3ecf8e] mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[#d4d4d8]">Tutor dedicado no Portal Lexi Alpha 24/7 (mínimo 15 min)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3ecf8e] mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[#d4d4d8]">R$ 197 por mês sem fidelidade ou contratos anuais</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3ecf8e] mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[#d4d4d8]">Garantia incondicional de 30 dias com devolução via Pix</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Final Button -->
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto mb-5">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5511967239791?text=Oi%20Gabe!%20Quero%20garantir%20minha%20vaga%20na%20Turma%20Alpha%20por%20R$%20197/m%C3%AAs"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#3ecf8e] text-[#0f0f0f] font-bold text-base sm:text-lg hover:bg-[#34b27b] active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-[#3ecf8e]/25 group"
      >
        <span>Garantir Minha Vaga no WhatsApp</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-[#898989] text-xs">
      Apenas 10 vagas disponíveis &bull; Início imediato &bull; R$ 197/mês
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
